{#
    The admin's entry page.

    WHAT IT REPLACED. Until 002-002-0003 this page was assembled by concatenating strings in
    `AdminController::indexAction()` — a proof artifact from story 001-007 whose job was to show
    that the mount and the asset path work, not to be a user interface. ADR 0010 left it that way
    on purpose and named this task as its successor, because rewriting a proof in passing is how
    a proof quietly stops proving anything.

    THE ENTITIES ARE IN THE MENU, NOT ON THE PAGE, since 002-002-0002. The layout renders the
    navigation as soon as this action hands over a `menu`, which is also what keeps
    `tools/harness-admin-pruefen.php` green — it requires every entity name of the schema to
    appear in the body, and the menu labels are those names.

    IT DECLARES THE `hello` CONTROLLER, and that is the one place in the package where the
    layout's Stimulus registration actually runs. The controller sets `data-admin-assets-ready`
    when it connects, which is a state a check can read without a person looking at the screen.
#}{% extends 'layout.html.twig' %}

{% block bodyAttributes %} class="admin" data-controller="hello"{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<main class="admin__main">
    <h1>{{ title }}</h1>

    <p class="admin__hint">Wählen Sie links eine Entität, um ihre Datensätze zu bearbeiten.</p>
</main>
{% endblock %}
